do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
[wait time="2.0"]
join TowerGuide rightmost [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
TowerGuide: Welcome to the Starspire Grand Market! We're glad you made it!
TowerGuide: This is the base of operations for the Starspire Hunters! Use the Grand Market to strengthen your abilities, grow your wealth, and prepare for your expeditions into the tower.
TowerGuide: Let me give you a quick overview of everything the Starspire Grand Market has to offer!
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_market_pos()
[wait time="1.0"]
TowerGuide: Come on over to the Trade Market to sell your plunder from the tower! Eventually, you'll unlock bulk selling, making it much easier to sell large quantities of valuable goods.
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_smelting_station_pos()
[wait time="1.0"]
TowerGuide: Welcome to Artisan's Corner! The backbone of Starspire operations.
TowerGuide: This is a Hunter's bread and butter for growing stronger!
TowerGuide: Down here, we have the Refinery Station... Well, we should. Looks like it's currently under construction. This happens from time to time, so no worries! It'll be up and running before you know it. With a little help from you, we may be able to get it running sooner!
TowerGuide: Anyways, the Refinery will be a valuable tool for crafting new gear and improving your combat abilities. Once it's back up and running, we'll provide you with a pickaxe so you can venture into the tower and bring back that precious ore!
TowerGuide: On the far right, you'll find the Job Requests Board! This is where Hunters can post requests related to the tower. Most requests involve hunting monsters or gathering valuable resources.
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_sword_crafting_station_pos()
[wait time="1.0"]
TowerGuide: Up here, you'll find two important stations\: the Gem Upgrade Station and the Weapon Crafting Station!
TowerGuide: Just as the name suggests, these stations are here to help upgrade your gear and make you a stronger Hunter.
TowerGuide: You'll have immediate access to the Weapon Crafting Station, but you'll need to prove yourself as a capable Hunter before the Guild grants you access to the Gem Upgrade Station.
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_dojo_position()
[wait time="1.0"]
TowerGuide: Next, we have the Class Advancement Center  - the heart and soul of the Starspire Hunters Guild.
TowerGuide: Here, you'll use AP earned from leveling up while hunting in the Tower to unlock and upgrade new class abilities.
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_cooking_station_pos()
TowerGuide: Lastly, we have the... uh, Junk-O... Junk-E...
do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio music "res://Audio/Music/WackyJunkATron.wav" [bus="Music"]
join ProfStooge leftmost [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
ProfStooge: Ahem..
ProfStooge: Allow me to Explain!
TowerGuide: (Oh boy.. Here we go)
ProfStooge: The name's Professor A.E. Stooge! But please, call me Prof. Stooge. Much easier on the tongue, wouldn't you say?
ProfStooge: Behold! The magnificent structure before you is my latest side project\: the "Junk-A-Tron"! Quite a catchy name, don't you think?!
ProfStooge: What Ms. Guide failed to clue you in on is that the Guild has been struggling financially for quite some time. The state of Velmoria has... well, let's just say they've lost faith in the Starspire project. After 14 months of stalled research, they've cut our funding nearly in half.
ProfStooge: It's become a rather unfortunate self-fulfilling prophecy, I must say. Without the necessary funding, we've begun losing Hunters. And without proper equipment or reliable employment, progress has become virtually impossible.
ProfStooge: Fear not! The Junk-A-Tron is the answer to our problems! I just need a little help finishing the final stages of development, and we'll have a prototype ready to show the Guild... our very own SELF-FUNDING ENGINE!
ProfStooge: How, you may ask, does this magnificent invention work?
audio music "res://Audio/Music/TutorialCutscene.wav" [bus="Music"]
TowerGuide: Sorry to interrupt your spiel, Prof. Stooge. Very inspiring stuff! Unfortunately, we're a bit short on time... and I have a feeling we could be here all day. We'll go into the specifics later.
ProfStooge: I can count on you to help me finish this, right, Sonny?
leave ProfStooge [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
[wait time="1.0"]
TowerGuide: Well, that's it for now!\
We'll go over things again as you continue your journey, but this should give you a great start on becoming a Starspire Hunter!
TowerGuide: Good Luck and may your bounty be plentiful!
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do CutsceneManager.play_map_theme_song()